9550	# THE way every writer changes a task's stores (D2, F04-3): codex-consult.ps1 (a single run,
9551	# a panel member) and codex-findings.ps1 (-Status, -Rate). Takes the write lock, then
9552	# RE-READS findings.json and sessions.json; the caller applies ITS OWN delta to these fresh
9553	# objects, writes them with Complete-StoreCommit (findings.json, then sessions.json) and
9554	# releases with Exit-StoreCommit in a finally. A store that no longer parses refuses
9555	# (Read-JsonStore; the lock is released on the way out). Not acquired within $TimeoutSec:
